window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Rockstar Starter Guide:</p> <p>1.Get guitar. Get good.</p> <p>2.Find that girl who drives you out of your damn mind.</p> <p>3.Make sure that girl refuses to be with you so you’ll have endless material for songs.</p> <p>4.Get tricked by your brother and her best friend into getting stuck with her in a remote cabin on a stormy night—with only one bed.</p> <p>5.Decide if it’s better to keep playing your game or risk losing her forever.</p> <p>Vera Kruger has dyed her hair every color of the rainbow and she’s turned two very important parts of me blue for as long as I’ve known her.</p> <p>She’s so deep under my skin that she’s a part of me, just like the small town we grew up in. No matter where I go on tour, she’s the one I wish I could come home to. Even if it’s to argue with her about absolutely anything.</p> <p>When I return to Beacon Harbor for the holidays, I’m not a screwup anymore. I could give her every single thing she won’t admit she needs. Vera thinks we’re too messed up to work together—we just need to get each other out of our systems.</p> <p>The truth is she is my system.</p> <p>Now the girl who’s always been hard on me is going to have a hard time getting rid of me.</p> <p>And I will fight with her every infuriating step of the way until she figures out I’m never going to leave her.</p>"; 
